  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can set traps swiftly.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Trap class feature or Learn Ranger Trap</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a full-round action to set a trap, you do not provoke attacks of opportunity. You can set a trap more quickly, though this provokes attacks of opportunity. In addition, if you set a trap as a standard action the DC for Disable Device and Perception checks and for saving throws against the trap is reduced by 2. If you set the trap as a move action they are reduced by 5, and if you set the trap as a swift action they are reduced by 10.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
